  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx - y = 7/9\n\n1/x - 1/y = 10{1over2}\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(a3 - b3) = (a - b)3 + 3ab (a - b)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nx - y = 7/9\n\ny - x = - 7/9 .....(1)\n\n1/x - 1/y = 10{1over2}\n\n⇒ (y - x)/xy = 21/2\n\n⇒ (- 7/9) × (1/xy) = 21/2\n\n⇒ 1/xy = - 27/2\n\n⇒ xy = - 2/27 .....(2)\n\nThen, (x3 - y3) = (x - y)³ + 3xy (x - y)\n\n= (7/9)³ + [3 × (- 2/27) (7/9)]\n\n= (343/729) - (14/81)\n\n= 217/729\n\n**∴ The value of (x3 - y3) is 217/729**",
